Case Study:

2
00:00:01.590 --> 00:00:03.723
Object Storage and Media Pipeline.

3
00:00:04.003 --> 00:00:08.206
Chapter 52, from the Case Studies part of the System Design Playbook.

4
00:00:09.956 --> 00:00:10.916
At a glance:

5
00:00:11.196 --> 00:00:12.369
Chapter at a glance.

6
