139
00:07:44.617 --> 00:07:45.491
Part 2.

140
00:07:45.771 --> 00:07:47.670
Core Concepts, Beginner to Deep.

141
00:07:48.920 --> 00:07:51.139
Intuition: a warehouse with a ledger.

142
00:07:51.419 --> 00:07:53.915
An object store is a warehouse and a ledger:

143
00:07:54.195 --> 00:07:59.315
The warehouse (data nodes) holds sealed boxes split into pieces across many shelves.

144
00:07:59.595 --> 00:08:03.733
You don't need every piece to rebuild the box: any 10 of 14 will do.

145
00:08:04.013 --> 00:08:09.709
The ledger (the metadata service) knows which box is where, who owns it, and what version it is.

146
00:08:09.989 --> 00:08:13.125
Big deliveries arrive in several trucks (multipart).

147
00:08:13.405 --> 00:08:18.611
The warehouse only signs for the box when every truck has arrived and the manifest checks out.

148
00:08:19.961 --> 00:08:22.158
Customers never come to the warehouse.

149
00:08:22.438 --> 00:08:26.811
They go to local shops (CDN edges) that stock popular boxes.

150
00:08:27.091 --> 00:08:34.110
When the product changes, you give it a new label (versioned URL), instead of chasing every shop to swap stock.

151
00:08:35.460 --> 00:08:36.420
Requirements.

152
00:08:36.700 --> 00:08:37.553
Functional.

153
00:08:37.833 --> 00:08:40.841
PUT or GET or DELETE objects by bucket and key.

154
00:08:41.121 --> 00:08:43.575
Multipart upload for large objects.

155
00:08:43.855 --> 00:08:47.524
Pre-signed URLs for direct client upload and download.

156
00:08:47.804 --> 00:08:54.332
Versioning; lifecycle rules (transition to cheaper classes, expiry); object lock for legal holds.

157
00:08:54.612 --> 00:09:01.417
Media pipeline: validate, scan (malware, forbidden content), extract metadata, make variants, publish.

158
00:09:01.697 --> 00:09:08.908
Delivery through a CDN; private objects (invoices, KYC) only via short-lived signed URLs.

159
00:09:10.258 --> 00:09:11.367
Non-functional.

160
00:09:11.647 --> 00:09:21.823
Durability ≥ 11 nines per object per year (design target); availability 99.9 to 99.99%.

161
00:09:22.103 --> 00:09:27.181
Uploads survive network drops without restarting; throughput scales with parallelism.

162
00:09:27.461 --> 00:09:33.306
Image p95 100 ms at the edge; correct content after updates within a minute.

163
00:09:33.586 --> 00:09:38.557
Cost per GB-month and per GB of egress minimised with tiers and caching.

