357
00:18:55.803 --> 00:19:02.416
Video: transcode to adaptive bitrate (HLS or DASH) renditions with a job queue (Ch 50).

358
00:19:02.696 --> 00:19:07.880
It is much more expensive: do it eagerly for published videos, and track the job state.

