476
00:25:44.864 --> 00:25:48.469
Catalogue, Seller experience, Security, Finance, SRE.

477
00:25:48.749 --> 00:25:56.685
Context, Uploads went through app servers and failed on mobile networks. rsync-replicated disks lost 40k photos.

478
00:25:56.965 --> 00:25:58.715
Originals were served to phones.

479
00:25:58.995 --> 00:26:02.920
A 7-day CDN TTL showed old packaging for a week.

480
00:26:03.200 --> 00:26:05.547
Invoices sat in a public bucket path.

481
00:26:06.897 --> 00:26:12.017
Decision, Managed object storage (erasure-coded, multi-AZ) with versioning.

482
00:26:12.297 --> 00:26:17.267
Direct multipart uploads via pre-signed URLs into a quarantine bucket.

483
00:26:17.547 --> 00:26:21.451
An event-driven pipeline (scan, EXIF strip, dedup, variants).

484
00:26:21.731 --> 00:26:28.089
Content-hashed image URLs with 1-year immutable caching behind a CDN and origin shield.

485
00:26:28.369 --> 00:26:31.163
Lazy transforms with the top two sizes eager.

486
00:26:31.443 --> 00:26:34.473
Private classes with KMS and signed URLs.

487
00:26:34.753 --> 00:26:36.075
Lifecycle tiers.

488
00:26:37.425 --> 00:26:48.049
Related ADRs, ADR-380 Object store: erasure-coded across 3 AZs; scrubbing on; cross-region copy for invoices (L1).

489
00:26:48.329 --> 00:26:50.655
ADR-381 Uploads:

490
00:26:50.935 --> 00:27:01.303
8 MB parts, 4 parallel, per-part and end-to-end checksums, pre-signed URLs valid 15 min, abandoned uploads aborted after 2 days (L2).

491
00:27:01.583 --> 00:27:03.844
ADR-382 Images:

492
00:27:04.124 --> 00:27:18.545
WebP or AVIF with JPEG fallback, sizes 80 or 150 or 300 or 600 or 1200, 300 and 600 eager, others lazy; perceptual-hash dedup (L3).

493
00:27:18.825 --> 00:27:33.225
ADR-383 URLs or img/sku/contenthash/wn.fmt, immutable, 1 year; product API TTL 60 s; no purges in the normal path (L4).

494
00:27:33.505 --> 00:27:43.063
ADR-384 Invoices: private, KMS, object lock for the retention period, signed URLs 5 min, access logged.

495
00:27:43.343 --> 00:27:44.303
Requirements.

496
00:27:45.653 --> 00:27:46.485
R1:

497
00:27:46.765 --> 00:27:52.077
No object loss from single-AZ failure; durability design target 11 nines.

498
00:27:52.357 --> 00:27:53.189
R2:

499
00:27:53.469 --> 00:28:00.253
200 MB uploads complete on networks dropping every ~16 MB, without restarting from zero.

500
00:28:00.533 --> 00:28:01.386
R3:

501
00:28:01.666 --> 00:28:10.690
Image bytes per product view at most 100 KB at p95; CDN hit ratio ≥ 95%.

502
00:28:10.970 --> 00:28:11.866
R4:

503
00:28:12.146 --> 00:28:15.730
A photo update visible to all customers within 2 minutes.

504
00:28:16.010 --> 00:28:16.885
R5:

505
00:28:17.165 --> 00:28:22.071
Private documents never reachable without an authorised, time-limited URL.

506
00:28:22.351 --> 00:28:23.759
Decisions in detail.

507
00:28:25.109 --> 00:28:30.720
Storage (ADR-380): use the provider's erasure-coded standard class.

508
00:28:30.000 --> 00:28:32.472
Don't build our own store.

