517
00:29:05.115 --> 00:29:08.464
Purges are kept only for takedowns (legal, safety).

518
00:29:09.814 --> 00:29:17.387
Private (ADR-384): signed URL issuance is audited, and downloads are rate-limited per user.

519
00:29:17.667 --> 00:29:18.691
Consequences.

520
00:29:18.971 --> 00:29:25.286
We depend on a managed store and CDN, run a pipeline, and need URL versioning in the catalogue.

521
00:29:25.566 --> 00:29:34.931
In return: durable storage at ~1.4 times raw, uploads that finish, 40 times less egress, and fresh images without purges.

