What happens to re-sent bytes and time?

895
00:56:18.749 --> 00:56:21.075
(B3) In L3, halve the traffic.

896
00:56:21.355 --> 00:56:23.531
How many variants does lazy save now?

897
00:56:23.811 --> 00:56:29.229
(B4) In L4, add a 10% purge failure rate and a 1-hour API cache.

898
00:56:29.509 --> 00:56:31.344
Which strategy degrades most?

899
00:56:31.624 --> 00:56:36.552
(B4) Design video upload and adaptive streaming for seller product videos.

